# Store text files with LF in the repository and check them out with LF on
# every platform, regardless of each contributor's `core.autocrlf` setting.
# Byte-exact test fixtures opt out by declaring `binary` in their own
# .gitattributes (see Test/data/).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
